            <div class="space-y-4 text-secondary leading-relaxed" style="font-size: 14.5px;">
                <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark"><i class="bi bi-info-circle text-primary me-2"></i>1. Information We Collect</h5>
                <p>AGM Rural College of Engineering & Technology (AGMRCET), managed by S.D.M. Jainmatt Trust, Varur, Hubballi, respects the privacy of our prospective students, current students, faculty, alumni, and website visitors. We collect personal information submitted voluntarily through our online inquiry forms, admission portals, feedback channels, and newsletter subscriptions. This includes details such as name, email address, contact phone number, academic qualification, and course preference.</p>

                <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark"><i class="bi bi-gear text-primary me-2"></i>2. How We Use Collected Information</h5>
                <p>Personal information provided on this website is used strictly for legitimate institutional purposes, including:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Processing admission inquiries and providing updates regarding CET, COMEDK, PGCET, and Management quota seats.</li>
                    <li>Sending official academic notifications, circulars, examination timetables, and college event updates.</li>
                    <li>Analyzing website usage statistics to improve navigation, digital accessibility, and server performance.</li>
                    <li>Fulfilling compliance requirements mandated by VTU Belagavi, AICTE New Delhi, and Government of Karnataka portals (e.g., SSP Scholarship).</li>
                </ul>

                <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark"><i class="bi bi-lock text-primary me-2"></i>3. Data Protection & Confidentiality</h5>
                <p>AGMRCET implements standard administrative, technical, and physical security measures to safeguard collected personal data against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. We do not sell, trade, or rent personal information to commercial third parties.</p>

                <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark"><i class="bi bi-cookie text-primary me-2"></i>4. Cookies & Web Analytics</h5>
                <p>Our website uses essential session cookies and standard web analytics to optimize page load speeds, remember user preferences, and analyze anonymized visitor traffic patterns. Users may choose to disable cookies in their web browser settings, although certain interactive features may experience reduced functionality.</p>

                <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark"><i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right text-primary me-2"></i>5. Third-Party Links & External Portals</h5>
                <p>This website contains links to official university and government portals, including Visvesvaraya Technological University (VTU), AICTE, KEA, DHI ERP, Virtual Labs, and State Scholarship Portal (SSP). AGMRCET is not responsible for the privacy practices or content of external third-party websites.</p>

                <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark"><i class="bi bi-telephone text-primary me-2"></i>6. Contact & Grievance Redressal</h5>
